This directory contains the libre-compendium.

libre-compendium is a collection of freely licensed Chinese STEM lecture
notes, problem sets, and papers, together with shared LaTeX
classes, packages, and build infrastructure under common/.

Copyright and Licensing:
Unless otherwise noted in individual files, documents in this collection
are dual-licensed under either:

  - GNU Free Documentation License, Version 1.3 or any later version
    published by the Free Software Foundation; with no Invariant
    Sections, no Front-Cover Texts, and no Back-Cover Texts, see the
    file COPYING.DOC for license terms; or
  - Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License,
    see the file LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0 for license terms.

Code, LaTeX classes/packages, and build scripts are licensed under the
GNU General Public License, Version 3 or any later version; see the
file COPYING for license terms.

This collection is distributed WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent
permitted by law.

See the file INSTALL for build prerequisites and compilation
instructions.

See common/doc/manual.tex and common/README for documentation on the
shared LaTeX classes, packages, skeletons, and conventions.

See CONTRIBUTING for guidelines on how to contribute.

